			measure 'Manual Driver Forecast (Summable) 2' = ```
					
					VAR SelectedYear = MAX('DateTable'[Year])
					VAR GrowthPct = [Output Growth Latest (Numeric)]
					
					RETURN
					SUMX(
					    VALUES('DateTable'[MonthNumber]),
					    VAR CurrentMonth = 'DateTable'[MonthNumber]
					
					    -- 2025 manual actuals
					    VAR Driver_2025 =
					        CALCULATE(
					            SUM('Driver Data'[Value]),
					            'DateTable'[Year] = SelectedYear,
					            'DateTable'[MonthNumber] = CurrentMonth,
					            'Driver Map'[Version] = "Manual"
					        )
					
					    -- Fallback to 2024 if missing
					    VAR Driver_2024 =
					        CALCULATE(
					            SUM('Driver Data'[Value]),
					            'DateTable'[Year] = SelectedYear - 1,
					            'DateTable'[MonthNumber] = CurrentMonth,
					            'Driver Map'[Version] = "Manual"
					        )
					
					    RETURN
					        IF(
					            NOT ISBLANK(Driver_2025),
					            Driver_2025,
					            IF(
					                NOT ISBLANK(Driver_2024) && NOT ISBLANK(GrowthPct),
					                Driver_2024 * (1 + GrowthPct),
					                BLANK()
					            )
					        )
					)
					
					```
				lineageTag: 0ffb1b7d-5867-4232-9fef-02f61f17e6a7

