			measure 'Forecast or Actuals dynamic total' = ```
					
					VAR ThisYear  = SELECTEDVALUE('DateTable'[Year])
					VAR ThisMonth = SELECTEDVALUE('DateTable'[MonthNumber])
					
					VAR ActualValue =
					    CALCULATE(
					        SUM('Driver Data'[Value]),
					        FILTER(
					            ALL('DateTable'),
					            'DateTable'[Year] = ThisYear &&
					            'DateTable'[MonthNumber] = ThisMonth
					        ),
					        'Driver Map'[Version] = "Total"
					    )
					
					VAR HasActuals =
					    NOT ISBLANK(ActualValue) &&
					    ActualValue <> 0
					
					VAR LastYearValue =
					    CALCULATE(
					        SUM('Driver Data'[Value]),
					        FILTER(
					            ALL('DateTable'),
					            'DateTable'[Year] = ThisYear - 1 &&
					            'DateTable'[MonthNumber] = ThisMonth
					        ),
					        'Driver Map'[Version] = "Total"
					    )
					
					VAR GrowthRate = [Output Growth Latest (Numeric)]
					
					VAR ForecastValue =
					    LastYearValue * (1 + GrowthRate)
					
					RETURN
					IF(
					    HasActuals,
					    ActualValue,
					    ForecastValue
					)
					
					```
				lineageTag: 66e2a637-4f09-428f-8fc8-9a4d68e45942

