			measure 'Forecast Total' = ```
					
					VAR ThisYear  = SELECTEDVALUE('DateTable'[Year])
					VAR ThisMonth = SELECTEDVALUE('DateTable'[MonthNumber])
					
					VAR ActualValue =
					    CALCULATE(
					        SUM('Driver Data'[Value]),
					    
					        'Driver Map'[Version] = "Total"
					    )
					
					VAR LastYearValue =
					    CALCULATE(
					        SUM('Driver Data'[Value]),
					       
					        'Driver Map'[Version] = "Total"
					    )
					
					VAR GrowthRate = [Output Growth Latest (Numeric)]
					
					RETURN
					IF(
					    ISBLANK(ActualValue),
					    LastYearValue * (1 + GrowthRate),
					    BLANK()
					)
					
					```
