			measure 'Weighted Activity Scaled + 5% 2' = ```
					
					SUMX(
					    BaseProcessWeights,
					    VAR _Substream = BaseProcessWeights[SubStream]
					    VAR _Weight    = BaseProcessWeights[Weight] / 100
					    VAR _Activity =
					        CALCULATE(
					            [Activity Scaled Year + 5%],
					            KEEPFILTERS(
					                'Driver Map'[Substream Abbreviation] = _Substream
					            )
					        )
					    RETURN
					        _Activity * _Weight
					)
					
					```
